  "keyFeatures": [
    "Uncertainty-aware AI workflow builder with visual node-based editor",
    "Python SDK for programmatic access to the platform",
    "Machine learning model training and prediction nodes",
    "Sensor designer for optimal sensor placement under uncertainty",
    "Resource and project management for collaborative teams",
    "Transparent, explainable AI grounded in probabilistic methods",
    "VisionEngine sub-product for uncertainty-driven computer vision",
    "Sovereign AI deployment with control over models and environments",
    "Support for sparse, incomplete, and uncertain data",
    "Token-based usage system for queuing and running workflows"
  ],
